This plugin is a port of the snippets engine of obsidian-latex-suite. Some files
are copied verbatim from it (src/default_snippets.js,
src/default_snippet_variables.js, src/snippets/sort.ts, src/snippets/options.ts)
and many more are close ports; see the header comment on each file. Both the
original and this port are under the MIT license, reproduced once below for both
copyright holders.

KaTeX (vendor/katex.min.js) is bundled unmodified and carries its own MIT
license, in vendor/KATEX-LICENSE.

